<h2>Questions from Beaverton property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Do you work with HOAs in Beaverton?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Townhome and condo associations often need a consistent scope across many units, and we work with boards and managers on that.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is my older ranch home harder to claim?</summary><div class="a"><p>Not harder, but older wiring, plumbing and materials can raise code and matching questions that the estimate should address.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you cover all of Washington County?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes, including Hillsboro, Tigard, Tualatin, Forest Grove and unincorporated areas.</p></div></details></div>
